---
/* THE DAY — ruled schedule table. P3: provisional times. */
---
<section class="day g-ember" id="schedule" data-fade>
  <div class="day__inner">

    <div class="day__titleblock">
      <h2 class="day__title--big">THE<br>DAY</h2>
      <span class="day__tag">No Bushels</span>
    </div>

    <div class="day__facts">
      <span class="day__fact">21 Nov 2026 · 09:00 – 18:00</span>
      <span class="day__fact">EU Centre, Warri</span>
    </div>

    <ul class="day__grid" data-placeholder="P3">
      <li class="day__card" style="--rot:-1.4deg">
        <span class="day__chip" style="--rot:1.8deg">09:00</span>
        <h3 class="day__title">Doors</h3>
        <p class="day__desc">Arrive, find the room, find someone to talk to.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="day__card" style="--rot:1.1deg">
        <span class="day__chip" style="--rot:-1.5deg">10:00</span>
        <h3 class="day__title">Opening session</h3>
        <p class="day__desc">Why we're all here, said out loud, once.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="day__card" style="--rot:-0.8deg">
        <span class="day__chip" style="--rot:2.0deg">12:00</span>
        <h3 class="day__title">Breakouts</h3>
        <p class="day__desc">Music one way, film another, writing in the corner.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="day__card" style="--rot:1.5deg">
        <span class="day__chip" style="--rot:-1.9deg">14:00</span>
        <h3 class="day__title">Break</h3>
        <p class="day__desc">Eat. Keep talking.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="day__card" style="--rot:-1.2deg">
        <span class="day__chip" style="--rot:1.4deg">15:00</span>
        <h3 class="day__title">Screening + performance</h3>
        <p class="day__desc">Somebody shows work that isn't finished yet.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="day__card" style="--rot:0.9deg">
        <span class="day__chip" style="--rot:-1.6deg">17:00</span>
        <h3 class="day__title">Closing</h3>
        <p class="day__desc">And then nobody leaves for another hour.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="day__note note">⚠ P3 · provisional. Real times required before launch.</p>
  </div>
</section>
